Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉 我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们公司终于也有豪华周五小周末日的制度了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,离开公司时看到天还很亮 我真的好感动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.24,0:00:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.08,0:00:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,被你发现我回家途中摸过狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.37,0:00:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,刚好看到有不少狗狗出来散步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就忍不住摸了几下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.30,0:00:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉 对不起对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在外面摸了其他动物之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.43,0:00:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,家里的宠物真的会很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.98,0:01:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,动物的嗅觉能力真是太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,说到嗅觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.73,0:01:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你家猫咪会舔你的化妆水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,舔化妆水
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.15,0:01:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我每次抹完化妆水 我老家的猫都会舔我的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,害我要拼命闪躲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不要舔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.62,0:01:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还有宠物喜欢舔刚洗好的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.83,0:01:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛好痛 刺刺的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉好像…有点恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,还好我家的猫咪不会这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,而且有些成分吃进肚子里会出问题嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.45,0:01:39.37,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8}抖抖抖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an4\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs45\1c&000000&\bord0\pos(219.44,119.14)}外出遇到时没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.33,0:01:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an4\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs45\1c&000000&\bord0\pos(217.15,184.29)}但无法忍受把狗狗味道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.58,0:01:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an4\fn方正准圆_GBK\fs45\1c&000000&\bord0\pos(221.72,238)}带进家里的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:18.97,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,420)}能干猫也能去生日派对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,已经早上了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 我要请假…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我吃不下啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.47,0:04:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,福泽小姐总是这么认真能干
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.39,0:04:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,而且她还养了猫 真的很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,简直就是女强人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.31,0:04:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她真的一个人住吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,福泽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,部长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我还没影印完
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不是要说工作的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.05,0:05:01.26,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8}幸来姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这是优芽写给你的信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:07.37,注释,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\pos(1475.43,639.14)\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp10\1c&000000&\bord0}部长的外甥女
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是生日派对的邀请函
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.40,0:05:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可…可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.15,0:05:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经好久没参加生日派对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这次我要出差 所以无法出席
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她就哭着要我必须转交给你不可
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我好高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:27.97,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8}给谕吉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.29,0:05:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这是给你朋友谕吉的邀请函
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,方便的话 请帮忙转交给他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正喵呜_GBK\bord0\c&HD4CDF7&\frz343.1\pos(1444,530)}优芽\N生日派对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fn方正喵呜_GBK\bord0\c&H000000&\1a&95&\frz345\pos(467,355)}地点 优芽家\N时间 11:30
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.89,0:05:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,事情就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我把优芽的生日派对的邀请函交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.23,0:05:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然会让优芽感到失望
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.81,0:05:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但也只能我一个人去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.63,0:06:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你该不会真的想去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,优芽的家人也在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.76,0:06:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,优芽的朋友也会到场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候该怎么向大家解释谕吉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎带料理和饮料来派对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有问题请打电话问我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,务必变装后再过来喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,优芽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,LOOK
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.07,0:06:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,变装啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,变装
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,请等下一班电车
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,变装派对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的确可以让谕吉混进去…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 什么混进去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,之后出问题了该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,难得你这么早下班
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是觉得不行 说什么都不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.79,0:07:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那个猫猫玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.50,0:07:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,该不会是要送优芽的礼物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,超可爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是迷你谕吉耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也帮我做一个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要带去公司
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.53,0:07:47.07,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an7}社会常识
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.18,0:07:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那也是玩偶吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,难到你也帮我做了变装服饰吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是老鼠耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,让我想起了文化祭了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么 要带去的料理吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以试吃看看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来超可爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.87,0:08:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.71,0:08:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉 我们还是回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,回去吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对会被发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.55,0:08:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,到底为什么我们要打扮得这么显眼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.35,0:08:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而且优芽家比我想得还要近
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.85,0:08:43.40,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an8}走路就到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,万一引起骚动 最惨的情况就是搬家耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,幸来姊姊 谕吉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.03,0:08:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,优芽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,优芽 我们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.83,0:09:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,天气很冷 快点进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}好厉害 连手都是猫手手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不 那个 我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快点进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上下去喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.22,0:09:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎大家来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好险部长出差了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,优芽生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.86,0:09:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好羡慕优芽喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.20,0:09:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.83,0:09:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么 布偶吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.79,0:09:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,熊标本
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.04,0:09:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛要主动成为焦点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.08,0:09:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你就这么想搬家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉 你来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,动了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那个果然是活的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.22,0:09:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,其实 我常在我家附近的药局看到他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.51,0:10:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直好在意他到底是什么生物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说 三丁目超市有巨猫出没
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,原来那个传闻是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是布偶装
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,最近的制作技术真的是越来越厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.37,0:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 为什么连平常也要变装
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 布偶装变装
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,福泽小姐 是馨公司里的职员吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,馨…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.75,0:10:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我总是受部长的照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.55,0:10:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,彼此彼此 我弟弟受你照顾了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是优芽的妈妈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.85,0:10:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好年轻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,很感谢优芽招待我们来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,前阵子 你们陪她去水族馆玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 让你们难得的假日泡汤了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我在家也只会睡懒觉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 您弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.41,0:11:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 馨是我弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她居然比部长还年长
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 她也比我年长
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.80,0:11:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我听优芽说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.13,0:11:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉真的是一只大猫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来 他到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.93,0:11:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才 优芽拉着他去二楼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是到母亲的房间去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲…指的是织冢部长的母亲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你没听说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是我和馨的老家喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,因为房子很大 所以就借来当派对场地了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,想参观我弟弟平常使用的房间吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,还有毕业纪念册喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,部长你早说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这样很尴尬耶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.47,0:12:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉 来 这里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.73,0:12:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你见的人在二楼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.53,0:12:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,上楼也没关系喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,外婆以前也养过猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,想看优芽收集UMYU-Sea的人聚集过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,有现场活动稀有周边喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.11,0:12:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.03,0:13:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这么可爱的声音 是优芽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,外婆的眼睛几乎看不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,它是我之前跟你说的谕吉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀它来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.80,0:13:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我是优芽的外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.57,0:13:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是只了不起的大猫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,毛也非常的柔顺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,让我想起以前养的黑猫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:14:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然它很久以前就到彩虹桥的另一端了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不过它是个聪明的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,优芽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,派对要开始了 你妈妈要我来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 这只猫很乖不会伤人的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谕吉的家人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个幸运的女孩子喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,能跟馅子猫一起生活
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.21,0:14:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我祖父经常这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,黑猫是馅子猫 是带来幸运的福猫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.90,0:15:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.99,0:15:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,优芽 生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,生日快乐 优芽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,生日快乐 优芽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.42,0:15:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,连面包都是亲手做的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,来 笑一个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们过来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.77,0:15:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,要再来喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.73,0:15:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,紧张死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.82,0:15:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,布偶风格的拉链 效果真好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我都想说你该不会真的是穿了布偶装的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没来这座公园了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉当时就窝在 那个长椅下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我祖父经常这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.91,0:16:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,黑猫是馅子猫 是带来幸运的福猫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,当时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.93,0:16:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚好想吃甜食
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不小心把谕吉看成萩饼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.19,0:17:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛好痛 爪子刺到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.90,0:17:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是今天的派对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,福泽还在短时间内准备好变装的服装
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.29,0:17:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道谕吉有没有来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么超真实的布偶装
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还好我今天出差
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,买特产回去谢谢她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,回到几天前
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 关于这件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.74,0:17:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 什么混进去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.11,0:17:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是觉得不行 说什么都不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.45,0:18:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那个猫猫玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,该不会是要送优芽的礼物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉 拜托你帮我也做一个啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我好想要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是刚好可以抱在怀里的尺寸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.89,0:18:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我的保护欲和母性被激发出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.27,0:18:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好想养猫喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:29.80,注释,,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(0,1000)}没有恶意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,最后谕吉并没有做给我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.36,0:18:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢您的搭乘
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.01,0:18:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没用的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:19:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说是公司的聚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.01,0:19:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但会不会太晚回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,每次都喝到搭末班车回来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,然后直接倒在玄关的程度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天她会在还没到家前就精疲力尽了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,先不论性别 这根本就是没用的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,再这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真的有人愿意娶她吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.14,0:19:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.10,0:19:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我在附近的公园休息
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.27,0:19:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,就…突然觉得好困…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.69,0:19:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:20:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不能做好危机管理的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,会被大自然淘汰的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,今天吾一定要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.76,0:20:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,敲醒这个废物…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谕吉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我要…再来一碗饭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.57,0:21:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再有公司聚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.74,0:21:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,吾就到附近车站等吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.59,0:23:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,吾乃能干猫是也
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.76,0:23:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,能干猫很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.56,0:23:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,拍猫猫时 有几个注意事项
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.65,0:23:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,猫猫会怕快门声
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.94,0:23:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,闪光灯会给猫猫的眼睛带来很大的负担
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.07,0:23:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,拍照时请务必小心 并把猫猫拍得可爱点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,下一集
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,能干猫很上镜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.70,0:23:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,想照吾就照吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.61,0:21:42.40,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(279,348.75)}インスタグラムにも載ってない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.40,0:21:45.16,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(274,342.5)}私の奥のこと見せたい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:47.45,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(229,286.25)}貴方だけの私に
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.45,0:21:50.37,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(295,368.75)}なってみたいなりたいなりたいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:53.33,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(292,365)}朝焼けの眼差しは冷たい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:55.96,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(265,331.25)}タバコが染みた服臭い
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:58.13,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(215,268.75)}夜が終わってもまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.13,0:22:00.84,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(269,336.25)}どこにも行けない帰さないで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.84,0:22:01.92,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(110,137.5)}Don't leave me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:03.59,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(140,175)}Do this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.59,0:22:06.01,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(244,305)}We can do this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:09.68,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(131,163.75)}We can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.68,0:22:11.06,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(138,172.5)}We can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:14.48,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(245,306.25)}これは　どうしようもなく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.77,0:22:17.11,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(236,295)}しょーもない恋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.11,0:22:20.61,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(349,436.25)}これもまた　好きになっちゃ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.61,0:22:23.36,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(278,347.5)}ダメとわかっていても…ってやつです
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:25.28,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(162,202.5)}I know　もうね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.74,0:22:28.62,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(290,362.5)}年頃ってやつが悪さをしていて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:31.54,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(275,343.75)}よくない男に惹かれちゃって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.54,0:22:34.21,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(265,331.25)}もっと　もっとで欲しくなって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.21,0:22:37.79,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(360,450)}摂氏0度で燃える青い東京
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.25,0:22:42.42,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(320,400)}夜の端くれだってそこそこに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:45.18,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(275,343.75)}私とあなたの真ん中で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:47.43,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(224,280)}要らないアイテム消して
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:50.26,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(282,352.5)}冬の花と咲いてみたかったの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.26,0:22:53.27,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(303,378.75)}始発の電車は太陽より
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.27,0:22:56.06,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(279,348.75)}強く私はずかしめる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.06,0:22:58.81,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(273,341.25)}もうこれ以上朝にならないで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.44,0:23:02.65,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(100,403.75)}永遠に昨日で
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:48.30,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(376,470)}たった一つだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.30,0:01:52.01,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(371,463.75)}君だけがいればいい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.72,0:01:59.77,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(705,881.25)}今日も明日も全てが　煌めいてゆく毎日が宝物です
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.19,0:02:10.78,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(360,450)}ありきたりで単純に
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.19,0:02:14.78,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(359,448.75)}人並みでいるはずだけど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:19.12,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(382,477.5)}当たり前を夢見ては
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:22.87,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(344,430)}器用に生きて損をする
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:26.25,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(340,425)}そんな時代です
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:30.34,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(349,436.25)}こんな世の中です
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:35.59,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(437,546.25)}空っぽな心を振り回しながら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:40.31,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(473,591.25)}生きる意味はあるかい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:45.81,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(383,478.75)}何もいらない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:49.48,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(367,458.75)}君だけが愛おしい
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:52.69,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(249,311.25)}気づけばそこにある拾い上げた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:56.86,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(417,521.25)}ときめきがキラキラ羽ばたく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:03:02.12,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(376,470)}こんな日常が
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:05.58,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(348,435)}続けばいいなんて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:08.21,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(161,201.25)}自分に素直なことが
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:13.51,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3\fad(528,660)}幸せへの近道にきっとなるから
